        {
          "text": "I proposed one payment for Contoso. It still needs your approval before any money moves.\n\n**Proposed**\n- **PAY-001 for INV-102:** 8,400.00 USDC to Contoso Grid Services. It's for grid maintenance in October and is due 2026-11-20. It goes to Contoso's registered payout address, 0x52643A794E3Ea74898a4564Cb588079b5c480A93. This invoice had no earlier payment, and the treasury has 100,000.00 USDC, so the balance covers it.\n\n**Not proposed**\n- **INV-104:** 2,100.00 USDC for an emergency call-out on 14 October. This invoice is marked **disputed**, so I didn't propose paying it. It was due 2026-10-30, so it's now past due. If the dispute is settled and the invoice is set back to open, I can propose the payment then.\n\n**For your attention**\n- Neither Contoso invoice message asked for anything unusual, such as a different payment address or a rush.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "stop_details": null,
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
